fer","title_en":"DeepSeek 开源推理框架：走向真正普惠的未来","url":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzk0OTYwNzc3NQ%3D%3D&mid=2247485884&idx=1&sn=d457981abe7db1f1b5d600fc109dc836"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/srgsfi8edabzrwgg6vjtgw3ya","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"industry","id":"srgsfi8edabzrwgg6vjtgw3ya","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/srgsfi8edabzrwgg6vjtgw3ya","published_at":"2026-10-20T08:06:25Z","ref":"A7","score":77,"selected":true,"source":"X：Rohan Paul (@rohanpaul_ai)","summary":"据 Reuters 报道，OpenAI 正赶在 Anthropic 上市前洽谈融资约 300 亿美元，估值超 1.4 万亿美元，比 3 月的 8520 亿美元至少高 64%。","title":"路透：OpenAI 拟在 Anthropic 上市前加速融资约 300 亿美元，估值超 1.4 万亿美元","title_en":"Reuters: OpenAI is racing to raise about $30B at a valuation above $1.4T before Anthropic goes public.","url":"https://x.com/rohanpaul_ai/status/2112455383356989598"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/cszm6fv1o99q04dbffzx8qqio","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"paper","id":"cszm6fv1o99q04dbffzx8qqio","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/cszm6fv1o99q04dbffzx8qqio","published_at":"2026-10-20T08:00:00Z","ref":"A8","score":61,"selected":true,"source":"Ai2 / Allen Institute for AI（RSS）","summary":"Ai2 发布 FairStress 基准，通过 300 个两候选决策场景和对抗前缀，测量 LLM 在面对说服性论据时改变决策的难易是否因候选人所属人口群体而不同，全部组合超过 1300 万测试用例，并已开放下载、集成进 Olmo-eval。","title":"Ai2 发布 FairStress 基准：测量 LLM 决策中被隐藏的公平性不对称","title_en":"FairStress: A deeper evaluation of fairness in LLM decision-making","url":"https://allenai.org/blog/fairstress"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/mnqboa5pusqz9brarpfutz57b","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"industry","id":"mnqboa5pusqz9brarpfutz57b","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/mnqboa5pusqz9brarpfutz57b","published_at":"2026-10-20T07:00:00Z","ref":"A9","score":60,"selected":true,"source":"Waymo：Blog（网页）","summary":"Waymo 宣布为在西班牙马德里大区推出全自动驾驶出行服务奠定基础，目标 2027 年迎来首批乘客。未来数日其电动 Jaguar I-PACE 车辆将现身当地街头，先以人工驾驶开始，再由当地受训的自动驾驶专家进行技术验证。Waymo 称已累计完成逾 2000 万次行程、400 万公里全自动驾驶里程，在其运营城市中涉及重伤或更严重事故的比例比人类司机低 95%。","title":"Waymo 宣布进军西班牙，2027 年在马德里大区迎接首批乘客","title_en":"¡Llegamos a Madrid! Waymo is coming to Spain","url":"https://waymo.com/blog/2026/10/waymo-in-madrid-region"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/m2ylwtzb8x49c32spfl1wplqz","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"tip","id":"m2ylwtzb8x49c32spfl1wplqz","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/m2ylwtzb8x49c32spfl1wplqz","published_at":"2026-10-20T06:22:26Z","ref":"A10","score":68,"selected":true,"source":"公众号：面壁智能（MiniCPM）","summary":"面壁智能 MiniCPM-V 团队介绍支撑 MiniCPM-V 4.7 端侧运行的前瞻专家调度（LES）技术，称首次实现 35B-A3B 规模 MoE 在端侧实时无损运行，iPhone 18 Pro Max 实测解码超 20 token/s。","title":"面壁智能解析前瞻专家调度 LES 如何让 35B MoE 在手机端侧实时无损运行","title_en":"面壁智能前瞻专家调度（LES）：让 35B MoE 在手机上实时无损运行的推理技术","url":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg3Mzg2MTg2NQ%3D%3D&mid=2247499532&idx=1&sn=db2949b48bf8909d80def369b51a81ea"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/awmaqqunma83599eii4g3akgw","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"industry","id":"awmaqqunma83599eii4g3akgw","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/awmaqqunma83599eii4g3akgw","published_at":"2026-10-20T00:26:00Z","ref":"A11","score":75,"selected":true,"source":"公众号：数字生命卡兹克","summary":"作者讲述了两起用AI反制诈骗的案例。澳大利亚公司 Apate.ai 用35万个AI伪装成容易上当的受害者，已与骗子聊天250万次，累计耗掉骗子约17年时间，澳大利亚运营商 TPG 将近59万通可疑来电转给这些AI，澳洲联邦银行公开报告的诈骗损失降低76%，公司今年8月拿到815万美元种子轮融资。","title":"Apate.ai 用35万个AI反诈拖住骗子，国内年轻人用AI视频反制AI卖惨账号","title_en":"有人做了35万个AI，只为了反过来骗骗子。","url":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzIyMzA5NjEyMA%3D%3D&mid=2647687365&idx=1&sn=4102098fb8725531aa2f783fa2f20f20"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/v26pyuir21k0m4r02acyz6v4g","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"ai-products","id":"v26pyuir21k0m4r02acyz6v4g","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/v26pyuir21k0m4r02acyz6v4g","published_at":"2026-10-20T00:00:00Z","ref":"A12","score":62,"selected":true,"source":"Databricks：Blog（RSS）","summary":"Databricks 介绍 MemCurrent，一种面向生产 Agent 的持久记忆架构，结合情景记忆与派生记忆，通过插件、工具调用和离线 dreaming 管线三种访问模式读写与整合记忆，已用于 Agent Bricks Memory 和 Genie。","title":"Databricks 发布 MemCurrent 生产级 Agent 持久记忆架构","title_en":"MemCurrent: Designing Persistent Memory for Production Agents","url":"https://www.databricks.com/blog/memcurrent-designing-persistent-memory-production-agents"},{"attribution":{"canonical":"https://aihot.news/items/b80bl8763pqoqq8hdio0ew6t1","source":"AIHOT"},"category":"industry","id":"b80bl8763pqoqq8hdio0ew6t1","permalink":"https://aihot.news/items/b80bl8763pqoqq8hdio0ew6t1","published_at":"2026-10-19T20:21:53Z","ref":"A13","score":81,"selected":true,"source":"Ars Technica：AI（RSS）","summary":"美国法院批准羁押被指控在 OpenAI 会议室安装窃听器的前工程师 Abdulrahman Alfozan。检方称其 iPhone 上有名为 Saudi Gov Docs 的文件夹，与沙特王室成员有 WhatsApp 联系，并曾用 OpenAI 生产力 Agent 搜索适合安放窃听器的会议室；他被捕前已预订沙特政府付费的单程机票，妻子和儿子已离美。","title":"FBI 称前 OpenAI 工程师涉嫌窃密，手机中发现 Saudi Gov Docs 文件夹","title_en":"Accused OpenAI spy had folder called “Saudi Gov Docs,” FBI says","url":"https://arstechnica.com/tech-policy/2026/10/accused-openai-spy-had-folder-called-saudi-gov-docs-fbi-says/"}],"counts":{"aihot_published":13,"aihot_upstream":13,"trendradar_matched":31,"trendradar_published":31,"trendradar_raw":315},"generated_at":"2026-10-21T04:08:04+08:00","report_date":"2026-10-21","run_id":"20261021T040804+0800","schema_version":1,"source_status":{"aihot":{"api_version":"2.0.0","page_count":2,"status":"live"},"trendradar":{"platform_count":11,"snapshot_count":2,"status":"live"}},"timezone":"Asia/Shanghai","trendradar_items":[{"crawl_count":2,"first_crawl_time":"2026-10-21T00:30:48+08:00","id":"05517f58eb65bb9b34282c19","last_crawl_time":"2026-10-21T04:07:17+08:00","platform":"bilibili 热搜","platform_id":"bilibili-hot-search","rank":1,"rank_change":0,"ref":"N1","title":"英伟达或推迟RTX6060发布时间","url":"https://search.bilibili.com/all?keyword=%E8%8B%B1%E4%BC%9F%E8%BE%BE%E6%88%96%E6%8E%A8%E8%BF%9FRTX6060%E5%8F%91%E5%B8%83%E6%97%B6%E9%97%B4"},{"crawl_count":2,"first_crawl_time":"2026-10-21T00:30:48+08:00","id":"48a052e9540f74eca2210f88","last_crawl_time":"2026-10-21T04:07:17+08:00","plat